{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268cXk77W2zD1794811995.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，天水圍天頌苑新近錄得N座頌琴閣高層10室成交，實用面積592平方呎，屬和諧式三房單位，向南，望樓景，居二市場放盤價438萬元，議價後減價20萬元，以 418萬元易手，折合實用呎價7061元。<br/>伍耀祖指，原業主於2000年1月以81.1萬元一手買入，持貨約26年，帳面獲利336.9萬元，單位期內升值約4.2倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.903543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:46:01.888347+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:43:01.232971+00:00","content_hash":"0d51d256cdee001caa78aabcd8c977c86723e2b912d71c54aa91c73684f68d4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}